<title>USA: Paccar Inc earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Paccar Inc earnings summary.</headline>
<text>
<p>BELLEVUE, Wash., April 29 (Reuter)</p>
<p>			1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary     $1.49		    $0.92</p>
<p> Net		 57,900		   35,700</p>
<p> Revs		1,443,400		1,027,700</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Year-ago first quarter net income includes $11 million of after-tax costs for the closure of the company's Canadian truck plant.</p>
